  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/pseudo-melito-clavis#PsMelito.Clavis.17",
    "work_id": "anf-works/pseudo-melito-clavis",
    "canonical_ref": "PsMelito.Clavis.17",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "The fingers of the Lord—The lawgiver Moses, or the prophets. In the Psalm: “I will regard the heavens,” that is, the books of the Law and the Prophets, “the works of Thy fingers.”",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": [
      600,
