    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/pseudo-melito-clavis#PsMelito.Clavis.31",
    "work_id": "anf-works/pseudo-melito-clavis",
    "canonical_ref": "PsMelito.Clavis.31",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "The knowledge of the Lord—that which makes men to know Him. To Abraham He says: “Now I know that thou fearest the Lord;” that is, I have made thee to know.",
    "chunk_index": 31,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": [
      600,
      1000
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "anf-works/pseudo-melito-clavis#PsMelito.Clavis.32",
    "work_id": "anf-works/pseudo-melito-clavis",
    "canonical_ref": "PsMelito.Clavis.32",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "The ignorance of Godis His disapproval. In the Gospel: “I know you not.”",
    "chunk_index": 32,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": [
